      "id": "7da03d84",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "Inspeccionamos los nodos seleccionados automáticamente."
      ],
      "id": "9acaffee"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "bs_df6.internal_knots_"
      ],
      "id": "7ac81f15",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "Estos valores corresponden aproximadamente a los cuantiles:\n",
        "\n",
        "$$25\\%,\\qquad 50\\%,\\qquad 75\\%.$$\n",
        "\n",
        "Podemos comprobarlos directamente."
